6. Termination and reinstatement

Rights automatically terminate on violation. Curing the violation within
30 days after first becoming aware reinstates rights unless a Licensor has
previously terminated Your rights for another violation. Otherwise written
permission from the relevant Licensor is required for reinstatement.
Termination does not terminate compliant recipients' rights or waive claims
arising from a violation.

